^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-03-20 14:42] observe — the root package still exports source .ts entrypoints and the current build only typechecks; there is no versioned JS dist artifact yet.
 >>[2026-03-20 14:42] decide — the first slice should produce a dedicated dist/release artifact without flipping the workspace's live resolution over to dist.
 >>[2026-03-20 14:42] observe — plain tsc emit is not enough because the current source graph depends on workspace-only aliases like @spw/cli and @spw/seed.
 >>[2026-03-20 14:42] taste — version truth should stay anchored in the root package manifest, with dist manifests derived from that source of truth.
}

